  "description": "These running boards are perfectly compatible with the 2009-2018 Dodge Ram 1500, 2010-2026 2500 3500 Crew Cab, and 2019-2024 1500 Classic. YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control in assuring that we provide only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2009-2018 Dodge Ram 1500 Crew Cab\n2010-2026 Dodge Ram 2500 3500 Crew Cab\n2019-2024 Dodge Ram 1500 Classic\nFeatures\nPrecise Fit: YITAMOTOR side steps are specifically built for 2009-2018 Dodge Ram 1500 & 2010-2026 2500 3500 Crew Cab, 2019-2024 1500 Classic; Confirm the product is compatible with your vehicle before purchase\nPerformant Design: YITAMOTOR running boards merge extra-long drop steps with a rugged texture finish to achieve a distinct off-road look; The 3D pattern on 4.7-inch step pads provides stable footing and minimal slippage, while also providing space to wipe off your boots\nSupreme Functionality: These step bars help protect your truck rocker panels from debris and reduce collision impact on the doors\n500 lbs. capacity: Fine textured powder coating offers exceptional rust and corrosion resistance so you can drive in any weather and on any road; Heavy duty all-steel Nerf bars can handle more than 500 lbs. load capacity on each side\nEasy Installation: Direct bolt-on installation with no drilling needed; All mounting hardware and installation instructions are included",
